Usage: az session <start|attach|stop|status|diagnose> [arguments]

Commands:
  start <issue-id>      Start a session for an issue
  attach <issue-id>     Attach to an existing issue session
  stop <issue-id>       Stop an issue session via daemon-authoritative stopped state
  status [issue-id]     Show all sessions or one issue session status
  diagnose <issue-id>   Collect session, worktree, operation, hook, and log diagnostics

Deprecated aliases:
  kill <issue-id>       Alias for stop
